### queue processing
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/queueProcessing
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "node_id":4
}

### check processing queue
GET  http://127.0.0.1:5000/queueProcessing

### queue crashing processing
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/queueProcessing
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "node_id":8
}

### Get processing result
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/processingResult/4

### Get processing result metadata
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/processingResult/4/metadata

### Remove all processing results
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/processingResult/all